<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: SOCCER-CZECH REPUBLIC BEAT BELARUS 4-1 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CZECH REPUBLIC BEAT BELARUS 4-1 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>PODEBRADY, Czech Republic 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech</p>
<p>Republic beat Belarus 4-1 (halftime 1-1) in a soccer friendly</p>
<p>on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Czech Republic - Rene Wagner 12, Karel Rada 63, 68, Patrik</p>
<p>Berger 71</p>
<p>Belarus - Maxim Razumov 40</p>
